---
const phone = '5213171323237';
---

<section class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-primary-dark text-white text-center relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('/img/hero-general.jpg')] bg-cover bg-center opacity-10 mix-blend-overlay" />

  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10">
    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">
      ¿Lista para transformar tu futuro?
    </h2>
    <p class="text-white/90 text-lg mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      Únete a más de 50 alumnas que ya emprendieron su propio negocio en belleza.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
      <a
        href="#cursos"
        class="px-8 py-3 bg-white text-gray-900 font-bold rounded-lg shadow-lg hover:bg-gray-50 hover:text-primary transition-colors"
      >
        Ver cursos disponibles
      </a>
      <a
        href={`https://wa.me/${phone}`}
        class="px-8 py-3 bg-transparent border-2 border-white text-white font-bold rounded-lg hover:bg-white hover:text-primary transition-colors"
      >
        <i class="bi bi-whatsapp mr-2" /> Agenda una asesoría
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-12 pt-12 border-t border-white/20">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
        <i class="bi bi-shield-check text-2xl mb-2 opacity-90" />
        <span class="font-medium">Certificación oficial</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
        <i class="bi bi-wallet2 text-2xl mb-2 opacity-90" />
        <span class="font-medium">Planes de pago</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
        <i class="bi bi-people text-2xl mb-2 opacity-90" />
        <span class="font-medium">Grupos reducidos</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
